>向</span><span begin="0:50.658" end="0:51.002">い</span><span begin="0:51.002" end="0:51.302">て</span></p><p begin="0:51.535" end="0:53.325" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:51.535" end="0:52.024">まだ</span><span begin="0:52.024" end="0:52.825">来な</span><span begin="0:52.825" end="0:53.325">いで</span></p><p begin="0:53.526" end="0:57.324" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:53.526" end="0:54.074">期</span><span begin="0:54.074" end="0:54.255">待</span><span begin="0:54.255" end="0:54.667">し</span><span begin="0:54.667" end="0:55.028">て</span><span begin="0:55.028" end="0:55.416">な</span><span begin="0:55.416" end="0:55.528">い</span><span begin="0:55.528" end="0:56.041">わけ</span><span begin="0:56.041" end="0:56.643">じゃない</span><span begin="0:56.643" end="0:57.324">けど</span></p><p begin="0:57.524" end="0:59.515" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:57.524" end="0:57.993">まだ</span><span begin="0:57.993" end="0:59.515">わからない</span></p><p begin="0:59.515" end="1:01.537" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:59.515" end="1:00.032">けど</span><span begin="1:00.032" end="1:01.537">言われたい</span></p><p begin="1:01.546" end="1:02.919" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.546" end="1:02.259">あなた</span><span begin="1:02.259" end="1:02.919">から</span></p><p begin="1:03.044" end="1:05.945" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.044" end="1:04.361">「可愛い」</span><span begin="1:04.361" end="1:04.660">っ</span><span begin="1:04.660" end="1:05.945">て</span></p><p begin="1:05.082" end="1:06.805" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.082" end="1:05.682">Wanna</span> <span begin="1:05.783" end="1:06.044">get</span> <span begin="1:06.044" end="1:06.204">to</span> <span begin="1:06.204" end="1:06.624">know</span> <span begin="1:06.624" end="1:06.805">ya</span></p><p begin="1:06.805" end="1:08.927" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.805" end="1:07.065">But</span> <span begin="1:07.065" end="1:07.526">I</span>